                "caption": "Figure 3:Overview of OraRL.The annotation is appended as an oracle rollout tonnon-policy rollouts.\nOn-policy rewards define the baseline, while the oracle separately strengthens promising rollouts and provides an adaptive anchor.\nSign-balanced pruning retains informative positive and negative rollouts together with the oracle, yieldingKKrollouts for the policy update.",
